  "solution": {
    "text": "Vant Hoff's factor (i) for $\\mathrm{Na}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4=3$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\therefore \\Delta \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{f}}= & \\text { (i) } \\mathrm{k}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\mathrm{m} \\\\\n& =3 \\times 1.80 \\times \\frac{0.01}{1}=0.0558 \\mathrm{~K}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  }
